sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant A as Auth API
    participant D as Database
    participant AD as Admin

    U->>F: register form
    F->>A: POST /api/auth/register
    A->>D: save user (pending)
    D-->>A: user + profile created
    A-->>F: JWT token
    F-->>U: redirect /pending

    AD->>A: GET /api/admin/users
    A->>D: fetch pending users
    D-->>A: pending list
    A-->>AD: pending list

    AD->>A: PUT status = active
    A->>D: update user status
    D-->>A: updated
    A-->>AD: approval confirmed

    U->>F: login
    F->>A: POST /api/auth/login
    A-->>F: token + active status
    F-->>U: access dashboard
